 ],
 "tags": [
  60
 ],
 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Pol Roger pezsgő készlet, amely egy fehér Pol Roger jégvederből és 6 Pol Roger márkajelzésű Lehmann 30 cl pezsgős pohárból áll.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A fehér pezsgőhűtő modern, enyhén ívelt forma, előoldalon fekete Champagne Pol Roger felirattal. Alkalmas egy szabványos 0,75 L pezsgőüveg jégbe hűtésére.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Jégveder méretei:<br>Magasság: 23,5 cm<br>Szélesség: 19,5 cm</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A készlet tartalmaz 6 Lehmann Reims – Franciaország pezsgő poharat a Collection Signature A. Lallement M5 sorozatból. Ezeket a gépi gyártású, ólommentes kristály poharakat mindegyike a fehér Pol Roger pezsgő logóval rendelkezik a talpán.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Pohár specifikációk:<br>Töltetkapacitás: 30 cl<br>Magasság: 21,8 cm<br>Átmérő: 7,4 cm<br>Ólommentes kristály<br>Gépi gyártás<br>Mosogatógépben mosható<br>Lehmann, Reims – Franciaország<br>6 darab Lehmann dobozban</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Állapot:<br>A komplett készlet új és soha nem használt. A poharak a Lehmann dobozukkal érkeznek.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A készlet tartalmazza: 1 Pol Roger pezsgőhűtő jégveder + 6 Pol Roger × Lehmann 30 cl pezsgős pohár + Lehmann doboz.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Pol Roger Champagne Set – Ice Bucket + 6 Lehmann 30 cl Champagne Glasses</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Pol Roger champagne set consisting of one white Pol Roger ice bucket and 6 Pol Roger-branded Lehmann 30 cl champagne glasses.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The white ice bucket features a modern, gently curved design with the black <strong>Champagne Pol Roger</strong> logo on the front. It is designed to hold and chill one standard 0.75 L champagne bottle with ice.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Ice bucket dimensions:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Height: 23.5 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Width: 19.5 cm</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The set also includes 6 Lehmann Reims – France champagne glasses from the <strong>Collection Signature A. Lallement M5</strong> series. These machine-made, lead-free crystal glasses each feature the white Pol Roger champagne logo on the foot.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Glass specifications:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Capacity: 30 cl</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Height: 21.8 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Diameter: 7.4 cm</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lead-free crystal</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Machine-made</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dishwasher safe</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lehmann, Reims – France</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Set of 6 in Lehmann box</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Condition:</strong><br>The complete set is new and has never been used. The glasses come with their Lehmann box.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The set includes:</strong><br>1 Pol Roger champagne ice bucket + 6 Pol Roger × Lehmann 30 cl champagne glasses + Lehmann box.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/champagneclub.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
